{"schema_version":"hadith-bank-search-record-v1","id":"iman-quran-ja-qiyamah-h02","language":"ja","source_language_code":"ja","book_key":"ahmad","edition":"iman-quran-excerpts-ae2c075","source_id":"quran-excerpts-ja-ahmad","provider_entry_id":"H02","title":"Hadith meaning excerpt — Al-Qiyamah study / H02","text_arabic":null,"text_translation":"アッラーがすべてのムスリムの心に備えられた、内なる戒め","number":{"source_entry_id":"H02","in_book":"17634","canonical":null,"numbering_scheme":"as_cited_in_source"},"narrator":{"name":"ナウワース・イブン・サムアーン・アル＝アンサーリー","evidence":{"path":"materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/NON-QURAN-SOURCE-RECORDS658.json","json_pointer":"/1"}},"source":{"name":"Japanese Quran-study Hadith excerpts — Musnad Ahmad","work_title":"Japanese Hadith excerpts in Quran-study materials","url":"https://github.com/blaghtayt-alt/iman-companion/blob/ae2c07599767ee7182c40d3ff2264fcdac98d182/materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/PARAGRAPHS-AND-SEMANTIC-RUNS658.json","record_url":"https://github.com/blaghtayt-alt/iman-companion/blob/ae2c07599767ee7182c40d3ff2264fcdac98d182/materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/PARAGRAPHS-AND-SEMANTIC-RUNS658.json","original_file":"materials/quran-excerpts-ja-ahmad/source-bundle.json","sha256":"e4b6bd8778276f9e59c7ab59f4fa81522ef7bcabc429f0b9522edc3d741b9c6c","record_locator":{"path":"materials/quran-excerpts-ja-ahmad/records.json","json_pointer":"/1"},"format":"json","original_metadata":{"title":"Japanese Hadith excerpts in Quran-study materials","repository":"blaghtayt-alt/iman-companion","commit":"ae2c07599767ee7182c40d3ff2264fcdac98d182","family":"qiyamah","source_token":"H02","url":"https://github.com/blaghtayt-alt/iman-companion/blob/ae2c07599767ee7182c40d3ff2264fcdac98d182/materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/PARAGRAPHS-AND-SEMANTIC-RUNS658.json","record_url":"https://github.com/blaghtayt-alt/iman-companion/blob/ae2c07599767ee7182c40d3ff2264fcdac98d182/materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/PARAGRAPHS-AND-SEMANTIC-RUNS658.json","original_locator":{"path":"materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/PARAGRAPHS-AND-SEMANTIC-RUNS658.json","git_blob_sha":"c9b471a138664182f37a834788aa26a2b583142c","sha256":"5d724da6742be81fbd2fbd79ee00f444b98dc43b624babb006aee14c5f73cc16","json_pointer":"/32/text","char_start":237,"char_end":264,"offset_unit":"Unicode code points in decoded JSON string","decoded_utf8_start":711,"decoded_utf8_end":792,"text_sha256":"50fc33640eea93ecad2cf8b713af670ff9d36c8308ffaef8d09028c5c44a07c5"},"metadata_locator":{"path":"materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/NON-QURAN-SOURCE-RECORDS658.json","json_pointer":"/1"},"arabic_locator":null,"source_classification":"hadith_meaning_excerpt","is_excerpt":true,"context_note":"This is an explicitly bounded source excerpt, not the complete Hadith. Separate occurrences are not distinct-Hadith counts.","original_source_metadata":{"id":"H02","sourceIds":["S02"],"title":"心の中にあるアッラーの訓戒","classification":"新たに作成したハディースの意味訳","paragraphIds":["word/document.xml:p0033"],"unitKeys":["75:2"],"reference":"Musnad Ahmad17634; al-Risalah29:181 onward","narrator":"ナウワース・イブン・サムアーン・アル＝アンサーリー","sourceAttributedGrade":"HadeethEnc掲載の評価は真正。伝承本文と各経路の評価は区別しています。","selectedJapaneseMeaningOrQuote":["アッラーがすべてのムスリムの心に備えられた、内なる戒め"],"bibliographyParagraphIds":["word/document.xml:p0304","word/document.xml:p0305"],"bibliographyText":["本書で新たに作成した意味訳。典拠：アフマド17634。ナウワース・イブン・サムアーン・アル＝アンサーリーから伝わる、まっすぐな道のたとえの全文を確認し、その結びの句をアラビア語から訳しました。公表された日本語訳からの引用ではありません。「内なる戒め」は、すべてのムスリムの心にあって、禁じられたことへ踏み込まないよう戒める働きを指します。「アッラーが……備えられた」は、その戒めとアッラーとの関係を文脈に沿って表したものです。既存の日本語刊行物の探索範囲と結果は、別添の出典記録に示します。"],"links":[{"paragraph":305,"label":"アラビア語本文と典拠","url":"https://dorar.net/h/UFImhHwF?osoul=1"}],"ArabicParentURLs":["https://dorar.net/h/UFImhHwF?osoul=1","https://hadeethenc.com/ar/browse/hadith/65049"],"contextAndVariantNote":"まっすぐな道のたとえの結びの句の意味訳です。道・壁・扉・二つの呼びかけの説明は、伝承全体に基づく要旨です。","requiredPublishedNoteIds":[],"quotationContextRequired":true},"original_context":"あるハディースで、預言者（アッラーの祝福と平安がありますように）は、まっすぐな道のたとえを示されました。その両側には二つの壁があり、壁には開いた扉が並び、扉には幕が垂れています。一人の呼びかける者が、その道を離れないよう人々を招き、もう一人は、それらの扉を開けないよう警告します。そして、その道はイスラームであり、二つの壁はアッラーの定められた境界、扉は禁じられた事柄であると説明されました。道の入り口から呼びかける者はアッラーの書であり、上方から呼びかける者については、『アッラーがすべてのムスリムの心に備えられた、内なる戒め』と示されています［アフマド：17634］。道には啓示による導きがあり、心の中には、境界を越えないよう押しとどめる注意の声があるのです。"}},"translator":{"name":null,"evidence":null},"translation_provenance":{"origin":"unknown","label":"Unknown","ai_translation":"unknown","basis":"Copied Iman/old-bank material: owner confirmation pending. Historical source wording and authorship metadata remain preserved.","human_involvement":"not_established","evidence_ids":[],"scope_note":"Original source metadata is preserved; current translation classification follows the recorded provenance evidence and owner policy.","policy_path":null,"current_policy":{"classification":"unknown","basis":"owner_withheld_confirmation_of_old_bank_copies","decision_date_japan":"2026-11-11","policy_path":"catalog/provenance-policy.json"}},"extraction":{"ocr_used":false,"method":"structured_source_quote","classification":"digital_text","evidence_fields":["extraction.ocr_used"],"conflicting_evidence":false},"topic_tags":[],"editorial_tags":[],"source_headings":[],"review":{"status":"source_extracted","independent_pro_qc":"not_asserted","release_status":"source_candidate","release_eligible":false,"certified_release_eligible":false,"issues":[]},"commentary":{"arabic":null,"translation":"This is an explicitly bounded source excerpt, not the complete Hadith. Separate occurrences are not distinct-Hadith counts.\nまっすぐな道のたとえの結びの句の意味訳です。道・壁・扉・二つの呼びかけの説明は、伝承全体に基づく要旨です。"},"benefits":null,"footnotes":[],"references":{"items":[{"book_key":"ahmad","collection":"Musnad Ahmad","number":"17634","scope":"main_quote","source_citation":"Musnad Ahmad17634","numbering_scheme":"as_cited_in_source","verification":"explicit_source_citation_not_independent_edition_alignment","locator":{"path":"materials/tadabbur/ja/extended/075-sources/NON-QURAN-SOURCE-RECO